        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-10-29T20:27:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. Got Playing Dice, Wageling, Losing to the Odds, Wageling. Then Who are you Fighting, but I won the next round by putting everyone at odd health, throat jabbing WM himself, and getting lucky with an environment play. He played Breaking the Rules, the Wageling made our healths even, and we won.</p>\n<p>It seemed a lot longer to me than it was, because I agonized over whether to set our health to even and hope the environment hit us for an odd amount, or Immutus came out, or hope for the best and go odd. Then I got tired (Narcolepsy FTL), took a nap, and came back to it the next day.</p>\n<p>We ended up with the fish (can’t remember his name) who hit a Wageling. We were safe.</p>",
