        "id": 183886,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-10-31T01:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got Who Are You Fighting and a handful of Wagelings to start.<br>\nThat was too many villain targets for comfort so I took out 2 Wagelings to flip the Master right away. Unfortunately he flipped Who Are You Fighting first off so I had to wade through 5 rounds whittling him down in HP while hoping another Wageling doesn’t get played. It worked out though, I flipped him, flipped him back (Wageling up this time,) and took him down for the Mint.</p>\n<p>The Endlings didn’t  really do much so except for using Whoops to take out the Refuge I let them be.</p>\n<p>Expat starting with Speed Loading and Hollowpoints was pretty helpful I must say, especially when Scholar played a Shotgun off the top of her deck.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
